{"2623680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call Of Dookie", "steam_appid": 2623680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4476290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/64f06512a9384c346e8cfeaf10ef0c46.webp?t=1774892129\" width=623 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine you went to the crapper and emerged an hour later to a monster apocalypse!   <br>Retro first-person shooter action inspired by 90's classics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/f13c0751eefccbcd4fb0aa22927b9235.poster.avif?t=1774892129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/f13c0751eefccbcd4fb0aa22927b9235.webm?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/f13c0751eefccbcd4fb0aa22927b9235.mp4?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/cc58607dbd97e874ea5487a76be8bee6.avif?t=1774892129\" width=623 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are family man Mike Hadley. Returning to work after your favourite lunch buffet required an immediate visit to the restroom. That's when it really hit the fan. Now you must fight your way through the monster horde to save your loved ones!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/705187eccc26e5c0c68bd784769cef40.poster.avif?t=1774892129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/705187eccc26e5c0c68bd784769cef40.webm?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/705187eccc26e5c0c68bd784769cef40.mp4?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/90e02892e683cd5d731652e6e49fd914.webp?t=1774892129\" width=634 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing beats bumping elbows with buddies next to you on the couch as you send a shotty blast upside their damn fool heads! Up to 4 players, just like your grand-pappy used to play!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online, LAN and local split-screen supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/82ac95d60b34125bec80238b1c0dcdfe.poster.avif?t=1774892129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/82ac95d60b34125bec80238b1c0dcdfe.webm?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/82ac95d60b34125bec80238b1c0dcdfe.mp4?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/3727c8e9274cb012fc6a700a9f3c2002.avif?t=1774892129\" width=623 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of monsters to blow to smithereens in story mode, showering chunks of bloody gore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many deathmatch scenarios including classic Free-for-all, King Of The Hill, Tag, Hold The Flag, Limited Lives, Golden Gun, and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable deathmatch: health regeneration, weapons, duration, scenario, level, characters, teams, reloading, big heads, speed, ammo, radar and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teams including 2-vs-2, 1-vs-3, and 2-vs-1-vs-1 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotguns, assault rifles, rockets, grenade launchers, proxy mines, lasers, and more. Oh my! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels designed for increased encounters and fast-paced showdowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives in each story mode level to move on or die a glorious death while trying!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a buddy, or two, or three and blast them in deathmatch or embrace them in co-op. Find out who your real friends are! Cheaper than therapy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the right amount of dookie</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/64f06512a9384c346e8cfeaf10ef0c46.webp?t=1774892129\" width=623 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine you went to the crapper and emerged an hour later to a monster apocalypse!   <br>Retro first-person shooter action inspired by 90's classics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/f13c0751eefccbcd4fb0aa22927b9235.poster.avif?t=1774892129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/f13c0751eefccbcd4fb0aa22927b9235.webm?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/f13c0751eefccbcd4fb0aa22927b9235.mp4?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/cc58607dbd97e874ea5487a76be8bee6.avif?t=1774892129\" width=623 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are family man Mike Hadley. Returning to work after your favourite lunch buffet required an immediate visit to the restroom. That's when it really hit the fan. Now you must fight your way through the monster horde to save your loved ones!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/705187eccc26e5c0c68bd784769cef40.poster.avif?t=1774892129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/705187eccc26e5c0c68bd784769cef40.webm?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/705187eccc26e5c0c68bd784769cef40.mp4?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/90e02892e683cd5d731652e6e49fd914.webp?t=1774892129\" width=634 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing beats bumping elbows with buddies next to you on the couch as you send a shotty blast upside their damn fool heads! Up to 4 players, just like your grand-pappy used to play!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online, LAN and local split-screen supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/82ac95d60b34125bec80238b1c0dcdfe.poster.avif?t=1774892129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/82ac95d60b34125bec80238b1c0dcdfe.webm?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/82ac95d60b34125bec80238b1c0dcdfe.mp4?t=1774892129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/extras/3727c8e9274cb012fc6a700a9f3c2002.avif?t=1774892129\" width=623 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of monsters to blow to smithereens in story mode, showering chunks of bloody gore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many deathmatch scenarios including classic Free-for-all, King Of The Hill, Tag, Hold The Flag, Limited Lives, Golden Gun, and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable deathmatch: health regeneration, weapons, duration, scenario, level, characters, teams, reloading, big heads, speed, ammo, radar and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teams including 2-vs-2, 1-vs-3, and 2-vs-1-vs-1 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotguns, assault rifles, rockets, grenade launchers, proxy mines, lasers, and more. Oh my! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels designed for increased encounters and fast-paced showdowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives in each story mode level to move on or die a glorious death while trying!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a buddy, or two, or three and blast them in deathmatch or embrace them in co-op. Find out who your real friends are! Cheaper than therapy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the right amount of dookie</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Imagine you went to the crapper, and emerged an hour later to a monster apocalypse! Retro first-person shooter action inspired by 90's classics! Old-school deathmatch &amp; co-op!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/header.jpg?t=1774892129", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/ce4d854d7117b68f1b8d85d1ae920faf93e38fd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774892129", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623680/ce4d854d7117b68f1b8d85d1ae920faf93e38fd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774892129", "website": "https://callofdookiegame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 10240.0 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.75GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 5GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.75GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 5 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 5GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "This game was built by Marrone Games in Ontario, Canada, and is made and owned by Marrone Game